# Fuzzer-generated seed corpus and crash artifacts are byte-exact inputs —
# any newline conversion would silently corrupt them (autocrlf is on for
# this repo's Windows contributors, and git's text/binary autodetection
# isn't reliable enough to trust for arbitrary fuzzer bytes that may not
# contain a NUL byte). Force them untouched, regardless of local
# core.autocrlf.
/fuzz/corpus/** -text
/fuzz/artifacts/** -text
